  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Community-based Conservation of the Communal Forest of Los Altos de San Miguel</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will strengthen the capacity of local community leaders to sustainably manage forested habitat in the central highlands of Guatemala, reforest habitat with 200,000 native trees, reduce anthropogenic pressure on habitat, and broaden community participation in habitat conservation.</narrative>
  </description>
